  "parser_recovery_authorization_text": "I approve one bounded local-only Lumi Code-Mixed-Dialog Be-DSTC2 parser-contract recovery successor after the fail-closed v0.2 runner attempt. Bind recovery plan SHA-256 cbc60297886e23f86ec981a893a67ebcb8a45d6c5405498ad8d404b75197476b, implementation SHA-256 41c1d6eef19b0e2387a89fad0c6138178a0074835b46843f5ecd2bf8a97de4aa, runner SHA-256 d7267b94716a28e53f2a884254ba3a67edf5905742bfd84867eef538c3555157, verifier SHA-256 b359e7f583e113c646510e7f8b66a6a20e1b0d7bb7388dfcb89e17d9caa958cf, test SHA-256 abe436f28488108e8723434bff9fedca0ecd103341049796643e130750a6214b, and failure report file SHA-256 05747d8c255802095b1b813323be07c5fb54b088475189b932b8af8b345a20f9 and internal SHA-256 1990ec2194c3f925147f84b3ee9485ac5da8fbe1bcd6787027eec1c3e23d76f5.\n\nAcknowledge that exactly one runner pass started but completed zero full candidate-mix audit passes, consumed conservatively at most 113,718 source-line reads, constructed and audited zero new candidate rows, read zero existing-candidate rows, invoked no verifier, and used zero network bytes, GPU, or inference calls.\n\nAuthorize only this parser repair: remove the requirement that a zero-tab numbered KB row be immediately adjacent to an api_call. Classify as KB context and rejection-only only an exact preserved nonempty entity, R_-prefixed relation, and nonempty value row; retain all ordinal, dialogue-boundary, whitespace, tab, API-response exclusion, provenance, rights, evaluation-prohibition, filtering, token, deduplication, owner-review, and raw-text rules unchanged. Add synthetic tests for KB after API, KB after an intervening natural response, malformed non-tab rejection, and API-call response exclusion.\n\nCreate a versioned v0.3 recovery plan, v2 implementation/runner/verifier/tests, attempt-002 private outputs, and v0.3 raw-text-free report and verification. Execute exactly two fresh sequential passes with at most 227,436 source-line reads, 629,432 existing-candidate row reads, 40,000 new-candidate row reads, 669,432 total candidate-audit row reads, 60 local runtime-minutes, 134,217,728 private-write bytes, 0 network bytes, 0 GPU use, and 0 inference calls. No retry after a started pass without new authorization. No source mutation, test-object access, external API, registry mutation, source promotion, dataset seal, SFT training, production promotion, remote access, instance action, or unrelated action.",
  "parser_recovery_authorization_text_sha256": "75b663ca0b91f2d8b7ed23014badaef717f8cfd6d87f15063cce07f78c82b327",
